---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About - Souzou Maker">
  <div class="about-container">
    <div class="about-content">
      <h1>About</h1>

      <div class="profile-section">
        <div class="profile-image">
          <!-- Profile image will go here - can be stored in public/assets or R2 -->
          <div class="placeholder"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="bio">
          <p>
            Hi, I'm Eammon Littler. I'm a graduate of Dartmouth College with a Master's in Computer Science.
            I currently work at Quel Imaging as a software developer, doing research in the world of
            fluorescence-guided surgery. While I grew up in warm and sunny Southern California, I now reside
            in White River Junction, Vermont.
          </p>

          <p>
            I've always been a maker, creating marble towers as a kid and playing with 3D printers as an adult.
            As a maker, the open-source community is very important to me. It's where I've learned a lot of the
            skills I have today. To give back to the community, I've worked towards creating clear guides for
            every project I post. Currently, my site is filled with 3D printing content. However, I have begun
            exploring ways to create interactive/useful webpage tools. Figma is my favorite website prototyper
            and GitHub pages help run my sites easily.
          </p>

          <p>
            My current interests include 3D design, electronics, cooking, and photography. I'm into fermentation
            and usually keep a jar of sprouting greens nearby. My sprouts seem healthy, but I'm not as confident
            about my water kefir...
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1rem;
  }

  .about-content h1 {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .profile-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 250px 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .profile-image {
    position: sticky;
    top: 2rem;
  }

  .placeholder {
    width: 250px;
    height: 250px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .bio p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .profile-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .profile-image {
      position: static;
    }

    .placeholder {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 250px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>
